   "announcedAt": "2022-05-07T19:19:57.000Z",
   "notes": [
    {
     "title": "Changes",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "Hi everyone,",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "I'm just writing a quick post to let you know that a new build of Embraced by Autumn has been uploaded!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "This build fixes a few minor typos which have been pointed out to me, but (most importantly) it fixes the issue which was reported to me about a year ago, where the VN refused to open on Linux. I have since discovered, after troubleshooting a little, this problem was caused by the version of Ren'py the old build of Autumn was made in. I've since updated the version of Ren'py I use to build my VNs, and have rebuilt Autumn, so it should launch on Linux properly now.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": true,
       "category": "other",
       "platforms": [
        "pc"
       ]
      },
      {
       "text": "As always, if you find any further typos, or any issues of any sort, don't hesitate to let me know. I'll try to fix things within a reasonable time frame!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "ebi x",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    }
   ],
